(7660295, 1248105, 83313, '<td valign="top">The photograph is actually pretty good high key work. I would think what hurt this was the bathroom humor and maybe it didn''t look a lot like a flower from that perspective. If you''d been able to work a squirrel into the scene, it may have worked out differently. It''s good to take chances now and then. Bravo!</td>', 'The photograph is actually pretty good high key work. I would think what hurt this was the bathroom humor and maybe it didn''t look a lot like a flower from that perspective. If you''d been able to work a squirrel into the scene, it may have worked out differently. It''s good to take chances now and then. Bravo!', '2020-04-27 13:21:14.000000', NULL, 0),
