(7660400, 1248105, 98565, '<td valign="top">Hope you get well soon, Wendy!<br/> <br/>I recognized your lovely carnation very clearly - side lighting or not...and thought it was a humorous idea!<br/>Actually I was also considering to make a flower from toilet paper for this challenge, but then I decided otherwise.<br/> <br/>Toilet related entries don''t go well here, this observation I''ve made some time ago...<a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1141236" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2055/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1141236.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2055/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1141236.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2055/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1141236.jpg"/></a> <br/>:-)</td>', 'Hope you get well soon, Wendy! I recognized your lovely carnation very clearly - side lighting or not...and thought it was a humorous idea!Actually I was also considering to make a flower from toilet paper for this challenge, but then I decided otherwise. Toilet related entries don''t go well here, this observation I''ve made some time ago... :-)', '2020-04-28 04:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
